OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMost areas will have a dry and
OL,6,Fsettled day on Sunday with plenty of
OL,7,Fsunshine, especially during the
OL,8,Fmorning. However, the east and more
OL,9,Fespecially southeast of England will
OL,10,Fsee showery rain and breezy weather,
OL,11,Fsome of the showers heavy.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloud and showery rain will
OL,14,Fextend westwards to affect much of
OL,15,FEngland and Wales overnight, the rain
OL,16,Flocally heavy. Scotland and Northern
OL,17,FIreland will have clear periods and
OL,18,Fsome frost.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
