OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FRain will move from England
OL,6,Fand Wales into Northern Ireland,
OL,7,Fsouthern and eastern Scotland on
OL,8,FMonday. Brighter skies following into
OL,9,Fthe south, and mostly sunny across
OL,10,Fnorthern and western Scotland.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
